  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nPBM24 lets you become the coach/general manager of one of the 2000+ professional teams around the world. Will you have what it takes to lead your team to glory? Meeting board and fan expectations will be key to reaching the top. You will have a multitude of managing tools at your disposal to shape a team with your own style.<p></p>\n<p>The strategy is yours and you will be responsible for your team’s playing style. Create your own basketball plays and use them during the games to spark a comeback or win it at the buzzer.</p>\n<p>You can choose from 90 domestic leagues, including 16 women’s leagues, from 60 different countries across Europe, America, Asia and Oceania. With more than 2000 teams and 60 000 players, the world of basketball awaits you.</p>\n<p>If that is not enough, your coaching skills might lead you to coach a national team. International basketball is now extremely competitive. Can you lead your national team to the top of the world?</p>\n",
